<main class="w-full bg-surface pb-space-xl"><div class="w-full flex flex-col"><!-- SEKSI 1: HEADER & HERO (Biru Muda / surface-container-low) --><section class="w-full bg-surface-container-low border-b border-surface-container pb-space-md md:pb-space-xl"><div class="max-w-[1360px] mx-auto px-margin md:px-margin-desktop flex flex-col w-full"><div class="w-full pb-space-sm md:pb-space-md flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-space-xs md:gap-space-sm border-b border-outline-variant/20 pt-space-lg md:pt-space-2xl"><nav class="flex items-center gap-space-xs font-label-caps text-label-caps tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant"><a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">Beranda</a><span class="text-secondary/40 font-bold">/</span><span class="text-primary font-semibold">Portofolio</span></nav></div><div class="pt-space-sm md:pt-space-lg"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end justify-between gap-space-md md:gap-space-lg pb-space-xs md:pb-space-md"><div class="max-w-3xl"><h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight leading-tight">Portofolio Kapabilitas Teknik &amp; Rekayasa Presisi Terverifikasi</h1><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-space-xs md:mt-space-sm leading-relaxed">Infrastruktur manufaktur mutakhir yang memadukan 15 insinyur berlisensi internasional (ASME, AWS, BNSP, Siemens, ASNT), mesin 5-axis multiaxis, serta eksekusi proyek presisi tinggi untuk industri kedirgantaraan, energi, dan otomotif skala global.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-space-sm md:gap-space-md mt-space-md md:mt-space-lg"><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-3 md:p-space-md rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col justify-between"><div class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-between"><span class="">Tenaga Ahli</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">badge</span></div><div class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1 md:mt-2">15</div><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-medium mt-0.5 md:mt-1">Certified Lead Engineers</div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-3 md:p-space-md rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col justify-between"><div class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-between"><span class="">Audit Kualifikasi</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-emerald-600">verified</span></div><div class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1 md:mt-2">100%</div><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-medium mt-0.5 md:mt-1">Lolos K3 &amp; ASME Sec IX</div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-3 md:p-space-md rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col justify-between"><div class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-between"><span class="">Disiplin Rekayasa</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">domain</span></div><div class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1 md:mt-2">4 Klaster</div><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-medium mt-0.5 md:mt-1">Spesialisasi Fabrikasi</div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-3 md:p-space-md rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/20 flex flex-col justify-between"><div class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-between"><span class="">Lisensi Valid</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">description</span></div><div class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1 md:mt-2">45+</div><div class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-medium mt-0.5 md:mt-1">Regulasi Internasional</div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-3 md:p-spa